<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Personal Archive | The Vault</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { background-color: #0f172a; color: #e2e8f0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; }
        .parchment { background-color: #f8f1e5; color: #2d2a2a; border: 2px solid #b8860b; }
        .nav-hover:hover { color: #d4af37; border-bottom: 1px solid #d4af37; }
        .archive-border { border: 1px solid #4a5568; transition: 0.3s; }
        .archive-border:hover { border-color: #d4af37; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2); }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen p-4 md:p-10">

    <!-- Header & Navigation -->
    <header class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-16 border-b border-gray-700 pb-8">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-serif italic text-[#d4af37] mb-6">The Private Archive</h1>
        <nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-6 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">
            <a href="#" class="nav-hover">Beranda</a>
            <a href="#" class="nav-hover">About</a>
            <a href="#" class="nav-hover">Asmaraloka</a>
            <a href="#" class="nav-hover">Sajak Asmara</a>
            <a href="#" class="nav-hover">Bait Ilahi</a>
            <a href="#" class="nav-hover">Jika Waktu</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content Area -->
    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12">
        
        <!-- Hero / Note Section -->
        <section class="parchment p-10 md:p-16 shadow-2xl relative">
            <div class="absolute top-2 left-2 text-[#b8860b] text-xl">「</div>
            <p class="font-serif text-2xl leading-relaxed italic">
                "Di sini adalah tempat di mana kata-kata berhenti menjadi sekadar deret huruf, 
                dan berubah menjadi fragmen perasaan yang disemayamkan dalam keheningan."
            </p>
            <div class="absolute bottom-2 right-2 text-[#b8860b] text-xl">」</div>
        </section>

        <!-- Grid Archive -->
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <!-- Custom Post Item -->
            <article class="archive-border p-6 cursor-pointer">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-[#d4af37] mb-2">Asmaraloka</h3>
                <p class="text-xs opacity-70 mb-4">Catatan tentang ruang di hati.</p>
                <div class="text-sm border-t border-gray-700 pt-4 italic">
                    Isi teks kamu di sini...
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- Custom Post Item -->
            <article class="archive-border p-6 cursor-pointer">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-[#d4af37] mb-2">Jika Waktu</h3>
                <p class="text-xs opacity-70 mb-4">Refleksi tentang linearitas.</p>
                <div class="text-sm border-t border-gray-700 pt-4 italic">
                    Isi teks kamu di sini...
                </div>
            </article>
        </section>

    </main>

    <footer class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-20 pt-8 text-center text-xs opacity-50 border-t border-gray-800">
        &copy; 2026 | Fragmen yang diselamatkan.
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
